<title>PHILIPPINES: Cebu Holdings 96 net at 215.012 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Cebu Holdings 96 net at 215.012 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cebu Holdings Inc posted an unaudited net income of 215.012 million pesos in the year 1996, documents submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Friday said.</p>
<p>Revenues from its real estate sales and interest income amounted to 1.212 billion pesos, while costs and expenses reached 976.176 million pesos.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were given by the Ayala Corp subsidiary.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
